Critique this Stack class implementation. Identify two design flaws:
```python
class Stack:
    def __init__(self):
        self.items = []
    def push(self, item):
        self.items.insert(0, item)
    def pop(self):
        return self.items.pop(0)
    def peek(self):
        return self.items[0]
    def is_empty(self):
        return len(self.items) == 0
```
